##RenderMan RIB-Structure 1.0
# Spec 029 Situations scene (tests/shading_contract): row 4 in a REYES frame: secondary hits of a mirror on a floor, specularhitmode "shader" (the default). A reflection traced from a REYES grid is not a row 1 hit.
version 3.03
Hider "hidden"
Option "shaderformat" "default" ["rslo"]
Option "sampling" "sampler" ["sobol"]
Option "sampling" "seed" [1]
Option "limits" "numthreads" [1]
PixelSamples 1 1
Format 8 8 1
Projection "perspective" "fov" 30
Clipping 0.1 100
Translate 0 0 5
WorldBegin
  Attribute "visibility" "int specular" [1]
  AttributeBegin
    Surface "sit_mirror"
    Sphere 1 -1 1 360
  AttributeEnd
  AttributeBegin
    Surface "sit_marker"
    Translate 0 -1.2 0
    Rotate -90 1 0 0
    Disk 0 6 360
  AttributeEnd
WorldEnd
